@gateway = http://127.0.0.1:9000
@jwt = replace-with-auth-service-login-token

### Requires USER JWT and explicit agreement to external processing; default AI-disabled mode returns 503.
POST {{gateway}}/api/ai/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"text":"CloudDrive uses separate auth, user, file and gateway processes.","allowExternalProcessing":true}

### Real SSE: progress counts only; exactly one validated result or error terminates the response.
POST {{gateway}}/api/ai/summary/stream
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: text/event-stream

{"text":"Summarize the supplied public project description.","allowExternalProcessing":true}

### 400 without sending text upstream.
POST {{gateway}}/api/ai/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"text":"Do not send this upstream.","allowExternalProcessing":false}
